<title>HONG KONG: Reuters first ex-Hong Kong air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters first ex-Hong Kong air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>This is Reuters' first ex-Hong Kong air cargo market report. It will be published regularly until a new version is issued at a later date.</p>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Hong Kong air cargo market rates in Hong Kong dollars per kg for a 100kg shipment, with volume-to-weight of six to one.</p>
<p>						 Sept 30    v.    Aug 30</p>
<p>			   EUROPE</p>
<p>HK-LHR					  20.85		 18.25</p>
<p>HK-FRA					  21.09		 18.50</p>
<p>			   USA</p>
<p>HK-JFK					  20.50		 16.56</p>
<p>HK-LAX					  20.95		 15.93</p>
<p>			   MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>HK-DXB					  15.18		  15.01</p>
<p>			   ASIA PACIFIC</p>
<p>HK-SIN					   9.06		   9.01</p>
<p>HK-TPE					   3.90		   4.06</p>
<p>			   AUSTRALIA</p>
<p>HK-SYD					  22.01		   22.00</p>
<p>* The rates in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.l</p>
<p>* All prices quoted in Hong Kong dollars.</p>
<p>* The tariff represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 8982 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
